The authoritative recovery state is derived from:
PostgreSQL
+
Object Storage
+
Immutable Audit Records
+
Configuration Repository
+
Deployment Definitions
+
Secrets Recovery Mechanism
The recovery system must preserve relationships between these components.

6. RECOVERY UNIT
The fundamental recoverable OneDraft unit is:
Organization
